---
import Page from '../components/layouts/expanded/Page.astro';
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<SiteLayout title="搜尋" searchable={false}><Page route="extra" extra={true}><section class="interior"><h1>搜尋</h1><p>輸入關鍵字，找這裡的文章。</p><link rel="stylesheet" href={base+'pagefind/pagefind-ui.css'}/><div id="search"></div><noscript>搜尋功能需要開啟瀏覽器的 JavaScript；你也可以從「文章」頁瀏覽全部內容。</noscript></section><script is:inline src={base+'pagefind/pagefind-ui.js'}></script><script is:inline define:vars={{base}}>window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',()=>{new PagefindUI({element:'#search',bundlePath:base+'pagefind/',showSubResults:true});});</script></Page></SiteLayout>
